        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amnoon Iyo Taamaar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Absaaloom ina Daa'uud wuxuu lahaa gabadh walaashiis ah oo suurad qurxoon, oo magaceedana waxaa la odhan jiray Taamaar; oo Amnoon oo ahaa ina Daa'uud ayaa caashaqay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Amnoon ayaa u dhibtooday oo u bukooday walaashiis Taamaar, waayo, iyadu bikrad bay ahayd; Amnoonna dhib bay la noqotay inuu wax ku sameeyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Amnoon wuxuu lahaa saaxiib, magiciisa la odhan jiray Yoonaadaab, oo uu dhalay Shimcaah oo ahaa Daa'uud walaalkiis; oo Yoonaadaabna nin sir badan buu ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu ku yidhi, Ina boqorow, maxaad maalinba maalinta ka dambaysa sidan ugu caatoobaysaa? War maad ii sheegtid? Kolkaasaa Amnoon wuxuu ku yidhi, Waxaan caashaqay Taamaar oo ah walaalkay Absaaloom walaashiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yoonaadaab ku yidhi, Sariirtaada ku jiifso oo iska dhig sidii mid buka, oo markii aabbahaa kuu yimaado, waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Waan ku baryayaaye walaashay Taamaar ha ii timaado, oo cunto ha i siiso, oo cuntadana hortayda ha ku samayso, aan iska fiirsadee, oo aan gacanteedana ku cunee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Amnoon wuu jiifay, oo wuxuu iska dhigay sidii mid buka, oo markii boqorkii u yimid ayaa Amnoon boqorkii ku yidhi, Waan ku baryayaaye walaashay Taamaar ha ii timaado, oo hortayda ha iigu samayso laba xabbadood oo moofa ah, oo aan gacanteeda ku cunee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Daa'uud Taamaar gurigii ugu cid diray, oo ku yidhi, Orod oo waxaad tagtaa gurigii walaalkaa Amnoon, oo isaga cunto u samee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Taamaar gurigii walaalkeed Amnoon ayay tagtay; oo isna wuu iska jiifay. Markaasay qaadday cajiin, wayna cajiintay, oo hortiisay moofa ku samaysay, markaasay moofadiina dubtay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo intay digsigii qaadday ayay hortiisa ku soo shubtay; laakiinse wuu diiday inuu cuno. Markaasaa Amnoon yidhi, Dadka oo dhan dibadda iiga bixiya. Iyana dibadday uga wada baxeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaa Amnoon wuxuu Taamaar ku yidhi, Cuntada qolka iigu keen, aan gacantaada ku cunee. Markaasay Taamaar qaadday moofadii ay samaysay, oo walaalkeed Amnoon qolka ugu keentay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markay u soo dhowaysay inuu cuno ayuu iyadii qabsaday, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Walaalay, kaalay ila seexo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay ugu jawaabtay, Maya, walaalkayow, ha i xoogin; waayo, waxan oo kale in reer binu Israa'iil lagu dhex sameeyo ma habboona, haddaba nacasnimadan ha samayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, bal xaggee baan geeynayaa ceebtayda? Oo adiguna waxaad noqonaysaa nacasyada reer binu Israa'iil midkood. Haddaba waan ku baryayaaye, bal boqorka la hadal, waayo, isagu ii kaa diidi maayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase yeeshee wuu diiday inuu codkeedii maqlo, laakiinse wuu xoogay oo la seexday, waayo, wuu ka xoog badnaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Amnoon iyadii si aad iyo aad u weyn u nebcaaday, waayo, nacaybkuu u qabay wuu ka sii weynaa caashaquu caashaqay. Markaasaa Amnoon ku yidhi, Kac, oo iga tag. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasay ku tidhi, Maya, saas ma aha, maxaa yeelay, xumaantan weyn ee aad igu bixinayso ayaa ka sii liidata tii kale ee aad igu samaysay. Laakiinse ma uu dhegaysan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu u yeedhay midiidinkiisii u adeegayay, oo ku yidhi, Naagtan hadda dibadda iiga saar, oo albaabkana ka soo daba xidh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyana waxay qabtay dhar midabyo kala duwan leh, waayo, dhar caynkaas ah ayay gabdhaha boqorka ee bikradaha ahu qabi jireen. Markaasaa addoonkiisii dibadda u soo saaray, oo albaabkiina ka soo daba xidhay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Taamaar waxay madaxa ku shubatay dambas, oo ay jeexjeexday dharkii midabyada kala duwan lahaa oo ay qabtay; madaxayna gacmaha saartay, wayna iska tagtay iyadoo aad u ooyaysa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa walaalkeed Absaaloom wuxuu ku yidhi, Ma waxaa kula jiray walaalkaa Amnoon? Haddaba walaalay, bal iska aamus, oo waxan qalbiga ha ku qabsan, waayo, isagu waa walaalkaa. Sidaas daraaddeed Taamaar waxay ku hadhay oo ku cidlowday gurigii walaalkeed Absaaloom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Boqor Daa'uud markuu waxyaalahan oo dhan maqlay, ayuu aad u cadhooday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Absaaloomna Amnoon kulama hadlin xumaan iyo samaan toona, waayo, Absaaloom wuu nebcaaday Amnoon, maxaa yeelay, walaashiis Taamaar buu xoogay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Absaaloom Oo Dilay Amnoon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo laba sannadood markay buuxsameen dabadood Absaaloom wuxuu lahaa kuwo idaha dhogorta uga xiira oo jooga Bacal Xasoor, oo ku taal Efrayim dhinaciisa, oo Absaaloomna martiqaad buu ugu yeedhay wiilashii boqorka oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Absaaloom boqorkii buu u yimid, oo ku yidhi, Bal eeg, idihii ayaan dhogorta ka xiiranayaa, haddaba waan ku baryayaaye, boqorow, adiga iyo addoommadaaduba i soo raaca anoo addoonkaaga ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii wuxuu Absaaloom ku yidhi, Wiilkaygiiyow saas ma aha, ee yaannan kulligayo wada tegin, waaba intaasoo aannu culaab kugu noqonnaaye. Oo isna wuu ku sii adkeeyey, habase yeeshee wuu diiday inuu raaco, laakiinse wuu u duceeyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Absaaloom wuxuu yidhi, Haddaba haddaanay saas ahayn, ii daa walaalkay Amnoon ha i raacee. Kolkaasaa boqorkii wuxuu ku yidhi, Muxuu kuu raacayaa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Absaaloom wuu ku sii adkeeyey inuu u daayo Amnoon iyo wiilashii boqorka oo dhammuba inay raacaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Absaaloom midiidinnadiisii amray, oo ku yidhi, Haddaba ogaada markii Amnoon intuu khamriga cabbo ku farxo, oo aan idinku idhaahdo, Amnoon dila, markaas waa inaad dishaan, hana baqina, waayo, sow anigu idinkuma amrin? Saas aawadeed dhiirranaada oo xoog yeesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo midiidinnadii Absaaloomna waxay Amnoon ku sameeyeen wixii Absaaloom ku amray. Markaasaa wiilashii boqorka oo dhammu wada kaceen, oo nin waluba wuxuu fuulay baqalkiisii, wayna wada carareen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo intay sii socdeen ayaa war u yimid Daa'uud, oo waxaa lagu yidhi, Absaaloom wuxuu laayay wiilashii boqorka oo dhan, oo mid qudhuhuna kama hadhin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii kacay, oo dharkiisii jeexjeexay, oo dhulkuu ku jiifsaday, oo addoommadiisii oo dhammuna agtiisa soo istaageen iyagoo dharkoodii jeexjeexay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yoonaadaab, oo ahaa ina Shime'aah Daa'uud walaalkiisii ayaa ugu jawaabay, Sayidkaygiiyow, ha moodin in la wada laayay wiilashii boqorka oo dhan, laakiinse waxaa dhintay Amnoon oo keliya, waayo, Absaaloom taas wuu goostay, wuuna ku talo jiray tan iyo maalintii uu Amnoon xoogay walaashiis Taamaar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba, boqorow, sayidkaygiiyow, waxan qalbiga ha ku qabsan, oo ha moodin in wiilashaadii ay wada dhinteen, laakiinse waxaa dhintay Amnoon oo keliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Absaaloom wuu cararay. Markaasaa ninkii dhallinyarada ahaa ee gaadhka hayay indhaha kor u qaaday, oo wax fiiriyey, oo wuxuu arkay dad badan oo ka soo socda jidka mara buurta dhinaceeda meel isaga ka dambaysa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yoonaadaab wuxuu boqorkii ku yidhi, Bal eeg, boqorow, wiilashaadii waa yimaadeen, oo sidii anoo addoonkaaga ahu aan kugu idhi, way noqotay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isla haddiiba markuu hadalkii dhammeeyey ayay wiilashii boqorku yimaadeen, codkoodiina kor bay u qaadeen, oo ooyeen, oo boqorkii iyo addoommadiisiina aad bay u ooyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Absaaloom wuu cararay, oo u tegey boqorkii Geshuur oo ahaa Talmay ina Cammiixuur. Oo maalin kastaba Daa'uud wiilkiisii ayuu u barooranayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaasuu Absaaloom u cararay, oo Geshuur u tegey, oo saddex sannadood buu halkaas joogay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boqor Daa'uudna aad buu ugu xiisooday inuu u tago Absaaloom; waayo, wuu ka samray Amnoon, maxaa yeelay, wuu dhintay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
